      "role": "user",
      "content": "idk i feel like i've checked all the sequence stuff. i'm looking at the customer object and everything seems active. it feels like there's just some random glitch happening where it works half the time but then 402s for no reason. do you think it could be some kind of weird edge case in how the API handles the request or just a network thing?",
